{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2023-01-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON FINALIZES ACQUISITION OF BEYOND6 CNG FUELING NETWORK', 'text': 'SAN RAMON, CALIF. & HOUSTON--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CHEVRON U.S.A. INC., A SUBSIDIARY OF CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX), TODAY CLOSED ITS PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED ACQUISITION OF FULL OWNERSHIP OF BEYOND6, LLC AND ITS NATIONWIDE NETWORK OF COMPRESSED NATURAL GAS STATIONS FROM MERCURIA ENERGY TRADING AND BEYOND6 FOUNDER ANDREW WEST.'}